Build readcon-db 0.2.0 against readcon-core 0.17.1 with readcon-core's default
features disabled, so the C API of the bundled readcon-core (its `capi` feature,
on by default) is not compiled into libreadcon_db or the Python extension, and
add the runtime-export-isolation Meson test. Needs
readcon-core-0.17.1_capi-feature-gating.patch in the vendored crate, which puts
that C API behind `capi`.

Provider repair candidate readcon-db-production.diff (sha256
3868f061bdca8e1ae145995f10e52ba79b9c2f1d14704e70e9f3a6c4c36ff2e4), written
against readcon-db 9cf3abf; it applies unchanged to the v0.2.0 tree. Only the
Cargo.toml comment differs: the candidate called readcon-core's C ABI
"opt-in", but it is a default feature that this provider disables.

diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index fe2c5f6..e5e09ca 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -26,8 +26,10 @@ mpi = ["dep:mpi"]
 
 [dependencies]
 heed = "0.21"
-# The pinned writer provides exact numeric CON and JSON round trips.
-readcon-core = "=0.17.1"
+# The pinned writer provides exact numeric CON and JSON round trips.
+# readcon-core enables its C API (capi) by default; disabling its default
+# features keeps this provider's exports to the documented rkrdb ABI.
+readcon-core = { version = "=0.17.1", default-features = false }
 thiserror = "2"
 serde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }
 serde_json = "1"
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 60030c5..3d77b1c 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -141,6 +141,12 @@ if get_option('with_tests')
         dependencies: readcon_dep,
     )
     test('runtime-dependency', runtime_consumer, env: {'LD_LIBRARY_PATH': ''})
+    export_isolation = executable(
+        'test_export_isolation',
+        files('tests/meson-wrap/export_isolation.c'),
+        dependencies: readcon_dep,
+    )
+    test('runtime-export-isolation', export_isolation, env: {'LD_LIBRARY_PATH': ''})
     test(
         'cargo-tests',
         cargo_prog,
diff --git a/tests/meson-wrap/export_isolation.c b/tests/meson-wrap/export_isolation.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ed797b1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/meson-wrap/export_isolation.c
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+#include <dlfcn.h>
+#include <stdio.h>
+
+int main(void) {
+    void *db = dlopen("libreadcon_db.so", RTLD_NOW | RTLD_LOCAL);
+    if (db == NULL) {
+        fprintf(stderr, "dlopen: %s\n", dlerror());
+        return 1;
+    }
+    if (dlsym(db, "rkrdb_abi_version_major") == NULL) {
+        fprintf(stderr, "missing rkrdb ABI: %s\n", dlerror());
+        return 2;
+    }
+    if (dlsym(db, "rkr_library_version") != NULL) {
+        fprintf(stderr, "readcon-core C ABI leaked from provider\n");
+        return 3;
+    }
+    return 0;
+}
